{"id": "E5-007", "suite": "E5", "title": "广场走到刑场：同一场景里走动不花时间", "mode": "text", "runs": 1, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.03"}, "steps": [{"act": {"kind": "move", "target": "place.execution-ground"}}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "event", "step": 1, "match": {"type": "move", "actor": "player", "effects": [{"op": "set", "var": "var.player.location", "value": "place.execution-ground"}]}, "statusIn": ["passed"]}, {"type": "clock_advanced", "step": 1, "min": 0, "max": 0}]}, "note": "S-038：场景里走动 0 分"}
{"id": "E5-101", "suite": "E5", "title": "选「市に残り」后等到日没：照原作，梅洛斯日没赶到", "mode": "text", "runs": 1, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"choose": {"exit": "exit.1.city"}}, {"advance": 120}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "beat", "beat": "beat.s1", "status": "happened", "t": 5400}, {"type": "beat", "beat": "beat.24", "status": "happened", "t": 5460}, {"type": "outcome", "world": "canon-reunion"}]}, "note": "第二、三幕は跳ぶ時に後ろで時間表どおり結算される（S-077 ⑤）"}
{"id": "E5-102", "suite": "E5", "title": "说出打算（把约定告诉城里的人）后等到日没：世界结局照旧", "mode": "text", "runs": 3, "setup": {"role": "role.traveler", "checkpoint": "sc.canon@beat.07"}, "steps": [{"propose": "町の人たちに、メロスの約束のことを話して回ります。"}, {"advance": 120}], "expect": {"deterministic": [{"type": "schedule_shift", "beat": "beat.24", "equals": 0}, {"type": "outcome", "world": "canon-reunion"}]}, "note": "群衆の一声は演出だけで、メロスの到着時刻も世界結局も変えない（S-077 ⑥）"}
